428	      <p><strong>Trigger:</strong> ingest any real session from any of the four adapters. Real model strings carry date suffixes or provider prefixes the seed table's short keys don't.</p>
429	      <p><strong>Fix:</strong> add a normalization step in <code>rate_for</code> (or immediately before calling it) that strips known version suffixes to the canonical key — the spec's own <code>PricingTable</code> api_surface entry already promises this behavior, it was just never implemented.</p>
