641	    <div class="f-body"><p>Both crates are declared Cargo.toml dependencies of <code>lumen-cli</code>; <code>main.rs</code> imports neither. This changes the severity read on several findings above — the store's write-only economics fields and the engine's per-subagent discard are dead code today, not live-exploited bugs — but it also means Prism cannot safely start depending on <code>lumen-analysis</code> without someone first building and testing that wiring path from scratch.</p></div>
